  "muscles": "Names are keys of the site muscle facts (app/mj-muscle-facts*.ts, lower case). side is relative to the movement direction (ipsilateral = same side as the movement, contralateral = opposite side, bilateral = both). Muscles that do not exist in the site facts go in unlistedMuscles.",
  "approximate": "All ranges are approximate textbook values for teaching, not measurements. The final anatomical check is done by the user.",
  "check": "Internal citation only: OpenStax A&P (CC BY 4.0) or Gray 1918 as general reference; not rendered."
